# --- Server (private) ----------------------------------------------------
# The signaling server is deployed to a VPS we control and is intentionally
# not pushed to public git. Anyone cloning this repo gets the client and
# the shared protocol package; that's enough to run the app against any
# compatible signaling endpoint.
server/

# --- Local dev workspace -------------------------------------------------
# go.work is convenient locally (lets us hack on shared/, server/, client/
# with one editor session) but the server reference would break for anyone
# who clones without server/. Each module's go.mod has the full dependency
# information needed to build it stand-alone.
go.work
go.work.sum

# --- Secrets -------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

